{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00800","headline":"郊庙歌辞 梁太庙乐舞辞 大合舞 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 梁太庙乐舞辞 大合舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"於穆皇祖，濬哲雍熙。\n美溢中夏，化被南陲。\n后稷累德，公刘创基。\n肇兴九庙，乐合来仪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00800.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00800","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}